        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milton Friedman, Jason Bedrick\n- Organizations: Friedman Foundation for Educational Choice, EdChoice, Sveriges Riksbank Prize in Economic Sciences in Memory of Alfred Nobel\n- Books: A Monetary History of the United States\n- Roles: Director of Policy\n\nFacts:\n- Milton Friedman co-wrote the book A Monetary History of the United States.\n- Milton Friedman won the Sveriges Riksbank Prize in Economic Sciences in Memory of Alfred Nobel.\n- On July 31, 1912, Milton Friedman was born.\n- The Friedman Foundation for Educational Choice was later renamed EdChoice.\n- Jason Bedrick is the Director of Policy at EdChoice.",
